        <mxCell id="risks" value="&lt;b&gt;⚠️ Trade-offs&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• Single server = single point of failure&lt;br&gt;• No WAF: firewall + fail2ban + proxy limits&lt;br&gt;• You run DB backups, upgrades, patching&lt;br&gt;• SSH exposed: keys only, IP-restricted" style="rounded=1;arcSize=6;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFF7ED;strokeColor=#F59E0B;fontColor=#78350F;fontSize=10.5;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=10;spacingTop=4;" vertex="1" parent="1">
